/P 373 0 R
/E (Employing a Mixed-Methods approach, the research combines Descriptive Research via quantitative surveys to measure loyalty metrics with Interpretive Research through qualitative interviews to capture nostalgic narratives. The study further explores how Generational Subcultures moderate this balance. It analyzes whether younger consumers are more influenced by the social appeal of global brands or the familiarity and cultural value of traditional local food culture. Ultimately, this research provides insights into cultural identity, how it continues to shape brand loyalty in Taiwan.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [3]
>>
