/E (result, people can travel more easily and reach places that are not close to public transportation stations. This also gives people another transportation choice for short trips. Because of this convenience, more people choose to use YouBike in their daily lives. This poster discusses how the connection between YouBike and public transportation has helped make YouBike successful in Taiwan and why it has become a popular transportation option for many people.)
/Pg 51 0 R
/K [0]
